scenario: a C file migrates, checks and runs

new directory
write tiny.c:
    #define SCALE 2

    struct Pair { int a; int b; };

    int add_pair(struct Pair p) {
        return (p.a + p.b) * SCALE;
    }

    int main(void) {
        struct Pair p = { 20, 1 };
        return add_pair(p) == 42 ? 0 : 1;
    }
run: with migrate tiny.c -o tiny.w --no-c-export --prefer-colon
expect file tiny.w contains: fn add_pair
run: with check tiny.w
run: with run tiny.w
